---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Operations and Scale"
  description="Operations leadership case study: datacenter-to-director progression, team scaling, P&L ownership, and measurable performance improvements."
  ogType="article"
>
  <section class="px-6 pb-20 pt-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <div data-reveal>
        <a href="/work" class="mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-textMuted transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-accent">
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 19-7-7 7-7"/><path d="M19 12H5"/></svg>
          Back to Work
        </a>
        <span class="block text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-textMuted">Case Study</span>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-balance text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-textMain md:text-6xl">Operations &amp; Scale</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-pretty text-lg leading-relaxed text-textMuted">
          Career progression at GCS Technologies from Datacenter Lead to Technical Support Manager to Director of Operations over a nine-year period.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 pb-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="100">
        <h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-textMain">Leadership Arc</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accentPurple"></span>
            <span class="text-pretty leading-relaxed text-textMuted">Managed a 30-person team and owned business-unit delivery quality.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accentPurple"></span>
            <span class="text-pretty leading-relaxed text-textMuted">Directed P&amp;L execution and strategic initiatives tied to recurring growth.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accentPurple"></span>
            <span class="text-pretty leading-relaxed text-textMuted">Exceeded revenue targets for seven consecutive quarters.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 pb-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="200">
        <h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-textMain">Operational Improvements</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accentPurple"></span>
            <span class="text-pretty leading-relaxed text-textMuted">Built internal training programs that increased utilization from 73% to 86%.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accentPurple"></span>
            <span class="text-pretty leading-relaxed text-textMuted">Implemented customer feedback loops that improved retention and service predictability.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accentPurple"></span>
            <span class="text-pretty leading-relaxed text-textMuted">Standardized escalation and delivery processes for better reliability under load.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 pb-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="300">
        <h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-textMain">Foundation</h2>
        <p class="text-pretty leading-relaxed text-textMuted">
          Started on bare metal and progressed through each stack layer into architecture and executive operations, which now informs practical decision-making across security and AI systems work.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
